{"ticker":"ola-electric","name":"Ola Electric","month":"2026-06","posts":[{"id":"valuepickr-644606","source":"valuepickr","author":"dpk1994","handle":"@dpk1994","community":"Ola Electric - Full Stack EV play?","timestamp":"2026-06-23T13:48:20.658Z","text":"After selling my entire holding in November 2025 at around ₹41, at a small loss, I slowly started accumulating again from the ₹23-24 range in March 2026. Since the lows of March 2026, I can actually see a decent turnaround - maybe not a spectacular one yet, but certainly a meaningful improvement. Sales are currently trailing around 15,000 units per month. Looking at the momentum, crossing 17,000-18,000 units per month does not look unrealistic with some more effort. If Ola can sustain volumes above 15,000 units, the automotive segment should ideally start generating some cash. However, I perso…","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/ola-electric-full-stack-ev-play/158490/452","sentiment":"bullish","likes":3,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-23T16:08:20.166Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-07-23T04:48:34.346Z"},{"id":"news-gn-fU1N0NWM2czRaV1JmQ3prOU5Ydy1VTWc","source":"news","author":"Business Today","handle":"Business Today","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-06-23T09:11:12.000Z","text":"Ola Electric shares climb nearly 6% from day's low; here's why","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-23T16:08:20.166Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-06-23T16:08:20.166Z"},{"id":"news-gn-ZoMzhfaXR5RGUyZjgxaElwdFJmTG9ScA","source":"news","author":"NDTV Profit","handle":"NDTV Profit","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-06-22T04:31:11.000Z","text":"Buy, Sell Or Hold: Reliance Industries, Tata Motors CV, DLF, Garden Reach Shipbuilders And Ola Electric — Ask Profit","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-22T06:55:22.770Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-06-22T06:55:22.770Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-644355","source":"valuepickr","author":"suryawomshi","handle":"@suryawomshi","community":"Ola Electric - Full Stack EV play?","timestamp":"2026-06-20T14:50:13.849Z","text":"I am using S1 Pro Gen 2 and used it for 40k kms what my observations most of the issues are related to software, poor quality parts, Mostly Throttle, Suspension, Fork parts, Belt and Brake pads. I wanted to buy 2 more scooters kept it on hold as service not improved, getting appointment is very very difficult and all service centres are now 20-30 kms away from my location, I call it digital lock out, I wanted to write a Detailed Mail/Post to Board of Directors, Investor relations, Local RTO and Concerned ministry on the company opening showrooms and selling vehicles without proper service netw…","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/ola-electric-full-stack-ev-play/158490/451","sentiment":"neutral","likes":13,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-20T15:20:53.317Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-07-20T05:03:07.553Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-644346","source":"valuepickr","author":"Ashish_Khandelwal1","handle":"@Ashish_Khandelwal1","community":"Ola Electric - Full Stack EV play?","timestamp":"2026-06-20T13:02:52.368Z","text":"Screenshot_2026-06-20-18-25-43-16_0b2fce7a16bf2b728d6ffa28c8d60efb 1080×2412 338 KB Can this be a game changer for Ola? Electric bike with 500km range..elegant looks is within 2 lakhs","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/ola-electric-full-stack-ev-play/158490/450","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-20T15:20:53.317Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-07-20T05:03:07.553Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-644323","source":"valuepickr","author":"sterling20000","handle":"@sterling20000","community":"Ola Electric - Full Stack EV play?","timestamp":"2026-06-20T08:02:20.843Z","text":"I have been really wondering - is the issue with product’s quality itself or it has been the servcie and parts availability. Reading the type of complaints etc. I sense it is the product itself also - total lockout due to software issue, parts malfunctioning too soon etc. Ather quality ahs been robust and they spent years perfecting ti for indian conditions. Ola bought the scooter company and then made patch upgrades on top of that platform, but they have always been saying product quality is top notch, and product price/value prop is also top - its only the service backlog. But then why so ma…","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/ola-electric-full-stack-ev-play/158490/449","sentiment":"bullish","likes":1,"comments":1,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-20T15:20:53.317Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-07-20T05:03:07.553Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-644081","source":"valuepickr","author":"hardik_shah1","handle":"@hardik_shah1","community":"Ola Electric - Full Stack EV play?","timestamp":"2026-06-18T01:55:02.018Z","text":"VAHAN - 2W EV Daily Sales Data | Ankmitra Abacus & Stocks You can check this.","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/ola-electric-full-stack-ev-play/158490/448","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-18T06:17:12.258Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-07-17T14:55:56.814Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-644073","source":"valuepickr","author":"keshugarg","handle":"@keshugarg","community":"Ola Electric - Full Stack EV play?","timestamp":"2026-06-17T18:24:28.708Z","text":"Google parivahan dashboard. On the website select tabular view on top right corner. On Y axis select maker and on X axis select fuel. Click on refresh. After that select two wheeler below the drop-down placed below refresh button. Select period for which you want to check data. It’s yearly or monthly basis. On left side there will be red arrow. Click the button. It is filter. Select TWO WHEELER in VEHICLE CATEGORY and PURE EV in FUEL. Click on refresh. You will get list of total registrations done by all the two wheeler ev companies for that period.","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/ola-electric-full-stack-ev-play/158490/447","sentiment":"neutral","likes":1,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-18T06:17:12.258Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-07-17T14:55:56.814Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-643931","source":"valuepickr","author":"Rahul_Singh_Dhek","handle":"@Rahul_Singh_Dhek","community":"Ola Electric - Full Stack EV play?","timestamp":"2026-06-16T02:23:58.139Z","text":"Ola guided for 40-45k sales They will be doing close to 41k sales Last 2 months sales 27.5k This month sales till June 15: 7k Another 7k and they will be closing around 41.5k , well in the guidance All this info is publicly available Check Vahaan portal Ask chat gpt Build your own conviction Verify data by yourselves","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/ola-electric-full-stack-ev-play/158490/446","sentiment":"bullish","likes":1,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-16T06:57:26.451Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-07-15T15:06:41.682Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-643925","source":"valuepickr","author":"Iamsantosh","handle":"@Iamsantosh","community":"Ola Electric - Full Stack EV play?","timestamp":"2026-06-15T21:20:40.550Z","text":"Does anyone have idea how to track daily sales? I see some people posting daily Ola Sales in X. Just curious how reliable are these numbers. I don’t think Ola will meet it’s guidance for Q1 which is their sales volume","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/ola-electric-full-stack-ev-play/158490/445","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":3,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-16T06:57:26.451Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-07-15T15:06:41.682Z"},{"id":"news-gn-kWDkyVVFYNDBPTTBDc3BvUHVQdkZnTXc","source":"news","author":"Business Today","handle":"Business Today","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-06-09T12:28:36.000Z","text":"Ola Electric shares climb over 103% in three months; is more steam left in the EV stock?","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-09T16:17:39.431Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-06-09T16:17:39.431Z"},{"id":"news-gn-4eFY5MkJwM1g3aVg5S3dUNEVTTkhEVmY","source":"news","author":"Business Standard","handle":"Business Standard","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-06-09T08:51:22.000Z","text":"Ola Electric stock sprint